  Correct. The concept of evidentials was borrowed directly from L=C3=A1ada=
n,
and indirectly from some Native American languages, which require you to
transmit information on how you know something to be true. za'a is in that
family, and there is no reason for the information you are reporting on has
to be occurring while you are reporting on it.
              --gejyspa


On Sun, May 14, 2017 at 5:00 PM, Jorge Llamb=C3=ADas <jjllambias@gmail.com>
